{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792828260, "covers_from": "2026-10-24T07:51:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-24T07:52:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792828320, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-24T07:51:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 70514, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北的路線太複雜，重慶南路接不上重慶北路。沒要去火車站但要繞過火車站。新生南路上不了新生北路高架橋。", "display_name": "中正代表 No.70,514", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T07:51:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 32142, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "育英街，路小車多，孩子上學都走在馬路邊緣很危險，不少路邊停車佔馬路，但沒停車格也沒紅線，無法檢舉。", "display_name": "文山代表 No.32,142", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T07:51:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 40177, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "北士科旁百齡里因為離承德路較遠，走路到劍潭站或士林站都要20分鐘以上，公車班次也不密集，有辦法處理嗎", "display_name": "士林代表 No.40,177", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T07:51:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 36863, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "交通", "content": "車道規劃需要學習日本一樣清楚直覺，不會常常搞到一條路左轉/直行/右轉卡在一起打結。同時改善畫線品質", "display_name": "南港代表 No.36,863", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 32142, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.32,142", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 40177, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.40,177", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 36863, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "南港代表 No.36,863", "district": "nangang", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 51127, "spr